{
  "name": "auto lottery",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const requiredTags = $('抽獎條件').first().json.requiredTags;\nconst deadline = new Date($('抽獎條件').first().json.deadline);\nconst filteredItems = [];\nconst cleanJsonArray = $input.all().map(item => item.json);\nfor (const item of cleanJsonArray) {\n  const commentText = item.text || '';\n  // 計算 '@' 符號的數量\n  const tagCount = (commentText.match(/@/g) || []).length;\n  const commentTime = new Date(item.timestamp);\n  if (tagCount >= requiredTags && commentTime < deadline) {\n    filteredItems.push(item);\n  }\n}\n\nreturn filteredItems;"
      },
      "id": "f5d478fc-570f-4a02-8774-54081fbb6e44",
      "name": "3. 篩選標記數",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -928,
        352
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const numberOfWinners = $('抽獎條件').first().json.numberOfWinners;\nconst participants = $input.all().map(item => item.json);\n\nif (participants.length === 0) {\n  return [{ json: { error: '沒有任何合格的抽獎者！' }}];\n}\n\n// Fisher-Yates shuffle algorithm\nfor (let i = participants.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {\n  const j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1));\n  [participants[i], participants[j]] = [participants[j], participants[i]];\n}\n\nconst winners = participants.slice(0, numberOfWinners);\n\n// 將結果打包成 n8n 可讀的格式回傳\nreturn winners.map(winner => ({ json: winner }));"
      },
      "id": "495ff6df-9ea2-47ee-b3f1-56f09cda8d62",
      "name": "5. 隨機抽出中獎者",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -544,
        352
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "=### 🎉 中獎名單 🎉\n\n{{ $items.map(item => \"@\" + item.json.from.username).join('\\n') }}\n\n### 下一步驟\n\n由於 Instagram API 的限制，n8n **無法自動私訊**中獎者或在留言區標記他們。\n\n**請手動執行以下操作：**\n1.  **公布**：複製上方的中獎者名單，以留言、貼文或限時動態的方式公布。\n2.  **聯繫**：請中獎者在指定時間內主動私訊您，以核對身份並領取獎品。"
      },
